      "text": "Place the water and the kombu in a pan and let the kombu soak for 30 minutes."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "Place the pan over medium heat. Just before the water starts to boil, remove from the heat and scatter the katsuobushi over the surface of the water."
    },
    {
      "@type": "HowToStep",
      "text": "After 3 or 4 minutes (the katsuobushi will have sunk to the bottom of the pot by this point), strain the stock through a strainer lined with muslin or a coffee-filter."
    },
